(6573257, 978810, 117717, '<td valign="top">The pop of red &amp; the adorable curls really give punch to this photo.  Love the textures &amp; also that she is looking away.  Stands out from the crowd!</td>', 'The pop of red & the adorable curls really give punch to this photo.  Love the textures & also that she is looking away.  Stands out from the crowd!', '2011-10-21 10:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
