(6574224, 979261, 124815, '<td valign="top">Although these kids are spectacular (how can one mark pictures with kids?!), I much prefer your older shot with the new born and  only the hand holding him.<br/>Perhaps I''m wrong attributing this to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=51793" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">dirt_diver</a> but I''m sure that he got a picture with a baby sitting just like this one</td>', 'Although these kids are spectacular (how can one mark pictures with kids?!), I much prefer your older shot with the new born and  only the hand holding him.Perhaps I''m wrong attributing this to  dirt_diver but I''m sure that he got a picture with a baby sitting just like this one', '2011-10-23 00:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
