(6577636, 979293, 69324, '<td valign="top">He''s a beautiful little boy Mike, and your right, there''s not much you can do to pose them at that age.  It''s really hard to be truly objective with photos of your own children and it''s a good composition, there''s just no wow factor for those with no emotional attachment.  Welcome to the joys of parenthood, your life will never be the same, in a good way.</td>', 'He''s a beautiful little boy Mike, and your right, there''s not much you can do to pose them at that age.  It''s really hard to be truly objective with photos of your own children and it''s a good composition, there''s just no wow factor for those with no emotional attachment.  Welcome to the joys of parenthood, your life will never be the same, in a good way.', '2011-10-27 12:15:02.000000', NULL, 0),
