(6578562, 979403, 68504, '<td valign="top">I have been wondering why this is so effective, why I couldn''t bring myself to comment. The extraordinary precision delivers a finely wrought tale, where the concentration on detail is a meditation on acceptance of the unacceptable. For some reason I am reminded of Rilke. in the Duino Elegies, a strangely abstract exhortation to plunge into the particular.</td>', 'I have been wondering why this is so effective, why I couldn''t bring myself to comment. The extraordinary precision delivers a finely wrought tale, where the concentration on detail is a meditation on acceptance of the unacceptable. For some reason I am reminded of Rilke. in the Duino Elegies, a strangely abstract exhortation to plunge into the particular.', '2011-10-28 16:32:37.000000', NULL, 0),
